<item name='HelpSubCatNumber'><number>2</number></item>
<item name='HelpEHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='1' leftmargin='1in' rightmargin='100%'/>
<par def='1'><run><font size='12pt' style='bold underline' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20' color='maroon'/>Summary of the buttons and special fields on the Project Form</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font size='12pt' style='bold underline' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20' color='maroon'/></run></par>
<pardef id='2' leftmargin='1in' rightmargin='100%' tabs='L1in L1.7500in L2.2500in L2.7500in L3.2500in L3.7500in L4.2500in L4.7500in L5.2500in L5.7500in'/>
<par def='2'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>	</run></par>
<pardef id='3' leftmargin='1in' rightmargin='100%' tabs='L1in L1.3750in L1.7500in L2.2500in L2.7500in L3.2500in L3.7500in L4.2500in L4.7500in L5.2500in L5.7500in'/>
<par def='3'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold underline' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Purpose:</run><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial'
 pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> This form is used to describe the different projects in the application.  It identified the people involved in the project and the budget.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='4' leftmargin='1in' rightmargin='100%' tabs='L1in L1.5000in L1.7500in L2.2500in L2.7500in L3.2500in L3.7500in L4.2500in L4.7500in L5.2500in L5.7500in'/>
<par def='4'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold underline' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Special Fields: </run></par>
<pardef id='5' leftmargin='1.2500in' rightmargin='100%' list='bullet' tabs='L1in L1.5000in L1.7500in L2.2500in L2.7500in L3.2500in L3.7500in L4.2500in L4.7500in L5.2500in L5.7500in'/>
<par def='5'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Principal Investigator:</run><run><font size='11pt'
 name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> The investigator receives the budget exceeding emails when the administrator click on [Got it] on an order for which the purchased amount exceed the maximum amount for the specific category: Operating, Travel, Contract, Capital or when the total budget is exceeded.</run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Section Head:</run><run><font size='11pt'
 name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> The Section Head receives emails when the administrator click on [Got it] on an order for which the monthly credit limit is reached or if the purchase amount is higher than 5000$ or if the remaining credit on the card is lower than the purchase order.  When a problem is identified with the credit limit, the card holder is also receiving an email.</run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Project Budget:</run><run><font size='11pt'
 name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> identify the budget for each category of the project (Operating, Travel, Contract, and Capital).  The calculations rules are explained below.</run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Committed amounts:</run><run><font size='11pt'
 name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> </run></par>
<pardef id='6' leftmargin='1.7500in' rightmargin='100%' list='bullet' tabs='L1in L1.5000in L1.7500in L2.2500in L2.7500in L3.2500in L3.7500in L4.2500in L4.7500in L5.2500in L5.7500in'/>
<par def='6'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>When the administrator click on the button [On Order] on an Order, the cost of the order is added to the committed amount.  </run></par>
<par def='6'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>When the administrator click on the button [Re-Calculate Budget] on the Project form, the system will go through all the order falling within the same FY than the Project and will re-calculate the committed amounts.  </run></par>
<par def='6'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>When an order is cancelled, the committed amounts are adjusted if that order was previously committed.</run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Card holders:</run><run><font size='11pt'
 name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> the name of the MasterCard and Visa card holders for the project.  These names will be used as the choices for the Card Holder field on the Order form.</run></par>
<par def='5'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Signing Authorities: </run><run><font size='11pt'
 name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>the name of the signing authorities for the orders associated to this project for which the purchase type is “Purchase Order”</run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold underline' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Calculations:</run></par>
<pardef id='7'/>
