<tablecell>
<pardef id='20' leftmargin='0.0104in' keepwithnext='true' keeptogether='true'/>
<par def='20'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Show Custom Calculation:</run></par>
<par def='19'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>This button is displayed only to the Administrators</run></par>
<par def='17'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>The system will calculate the budget for all orders falling in between the dates entered by the user.  The date is based on the creation date of the order.</run></par>
<par def='17'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>Only the Orders for which the budget has been calculated will be considered.  Note that the budget for the orders having the green check mark in the “View by Project” has been calculated.</run></par>
<par def='17'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>The results are displayed only and cannot be saved.  The Orders and the project are not modified by this button.</run></par></tablecell></tablerow>
<tablerow>
