<tablecell>
<par def='16'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Add New Employee To Orders:</run></par>
<par def='19'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>This button can be used only by the Administrators</run></par>
<par def='19'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>The user will be asked to type an employee's name.  That name will be added as Reader and Author for all the Orders for that project. </run></par></tablecell></tablerow>
